000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ROLS6004.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT HISTORY-FILE ASSIGN TO "data/order_history.dat"
000700       ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 FILE SECTION.
001000 FD HISTORY-FILE.
001100 01 HISTORY-REC.
001200    05 H-EVENT PIC X(12).
001300    05 H-ORDER-ID PIC 9(6).
001400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001500 COPY CPM-ORDER.
001600 COPY CPM-PAR9001.
001700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001800 MAIN.
001900     ACCEPT ORD-ID
002000     MOVE ORD-ID TO VAL-ORDER-ID
002100     MOVE 1 TO VAL-QUANTITY
002200     CALL "ROLS9001" USING VALIDATION-PARAMETERS
002300     IF VAL-RESULT = "Y"
002400        MOVE "CANCELLED" TO H-EVENT
002500        MOVE ORD-ID TO H-ORDER-ID
002600        OPEN EXTEND HISTORY-FILE
002700        WRITE HISTORY-REC
002800        CLOSE HISTORY-FILE
002900        CALL "ROLS9003" USING ORD-ID
003000        DISPLAY "OK CANCELLATION RECORDED"
003100     ELSE
003200        DISPLAY VAL-MESSAGE
003300     END-IF
003400     EXIT PROGRAM.
